<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 601 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 601 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the first of two credit auctions whereby it sought to inject 601 million pesos into the secondary market Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT	   TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    400 million    20 days  20.30 pct</p>
<p>    201 million     1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
